<title>UK: Greycoat buys building for 13.6 mln stg.</title>
<headline>Greycoat buys building for 13.6 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>British property group Greycoat Plc said on Wednesday it had completed the purchase of an office building in London's financial district for 13.6 million stg.</p>
<p>The property group said in a statement it had bought the property from Lothbury Property Trust and would fund the acquisition from its own cash resources.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
